From aac86dc37113c35a5f77fe1d267475166bc856ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:46:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Deploy Zigcube's apt suite and rpm tree beside Zigbox's

A second fetch step takes zigcube-repos.tar.gz from the newest Zigcube
release that has one and accepts only apt/dists/zigcube/**,
apt/pool/main/z/zigcube*/**, apt/pool/main/z/zigbox-dev/** and
rpm/zigcube/**: no keyring, dot file, .html, test key or to-sign, and no
path Zigbox's asset also holds. Its files join the same manifest, so the
byte-for-byte check after deploying covers both. Zigbox's step and its
refusals are unchanged. The check is .github/check-zigcube-asset.sh,
table-tested by check-zigcube-asset-test.sh.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RfMZXKcdWukYanC6ZupoKb
Signed-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
